# Cold boot to the first standing tick in King's Pass, on the shipping disc, no cheats and no
# route-input feature: the title, Start Game, an empty profile (a new game), two presses that skip
# the poem and the opening movies, the drop from the top gate and the landing on the ledge.
wait 300                                       # the title opens its input at about 245 ticks
press cross                                    # Start Game
wait 40
press cross                                    # profile 1, an empty one: a new game
wait 540                                       # the poem's first lines
press triangle                                 # any button: the skip prompt
wait 40
press triangle                                 # a second press skips the rest
wait until HK_REGION_ID == 79 timeout 7200     # the Knight drops in (79 = the top view of the shaft)
wait until y gt 45.8 timeout 600               # he is at the top of the shaft
wait until y lt 12.2 timeout 1200              # he has landed on the ledge
wait 120                                       # and stands up
